  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nStep 27 of [create navigation params by fetching](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#create-navigation-params-by-fetching) creates a NavigationParams without specifying a value for the iframe element referrer policy.\n\ncc: @zcorpan, related to #11560.",
